would send the 120 cm pole cut to 88 cm, which is 16 cm off each end, and it still fits even if the window is a little wider or narrower than measured. If we go by your 59 cm I would send the same 120 cm pole cut to 94 cm, which is 13 cm off each end.\n\nThe finials add 9 cm at each end so please check you have clearance beyond the brackets. Could you confirm which edges your 59 cm was measured between so I send the right cut.\n\nBest wishes, Rob","questions":["Could you confirm which edges your 59 cm runs between, for example is it the recess opening around the set-back window where the pole would span the opening, or the window frame itself, so I know whether to cut to 88 cm or 94 cm?"],"ranOn":"meta-models/muse-spark-open on Baseten","attempt":1},"fps":3,"blinds":{"options":[{"fit":"outside, standard","widthMm":630,"dropMm":null,"overlapEachSideMm":50,"note":"covers the opening with a little to spare each side"},{"fit":"outside, blackout","widthMm":690,"dropMm":null,"overlapEachSideMm":80,"note":"wider overlap so less light gets round the sides"},{"fit":"inside the recess","widthMm":520,"dropMm":null,"overlapEachSideMm":0,"note":"a guide only: check the recess width with a tape before ordering, as an inside blind has to be exact"}],"draft":{"reply":"Hello, thanks for the clip with the paper sheet.\n\nI measured the recess opening on the wall at 53.5 cm.\n\nFor an outside fit, order 63 cm width for standard or 69 cm width for blackout to keep more light out at the sides.\n\nFor inside the recess, 52 cm width is a guide only. Please check the recess width with a tape before ordering it, as a measurement from a video can be a few centimetres out and a blind inside a recess has to be exact.\n\nI could not measure the drop from the clip. Could you measure the height and tell me which edges you measured between?\n\nBest wishes","questions":["Could you measure the height for the drop and let me know which top and bottom edges you measured between?","Could you confirm the recess width with a tape before ordering an inside fit?"]},"model":"muse-spark-1.3"}}